 to  show the students all the possibilities  that were out there that got them  curious and then we just started  developing curriculum to get them into  the community and on the streets where  does your teaching passion come from  it comes from growing up in the city of  philadelphia and just wanting that male  mentor that family sort of lifestyle i  had a rough upbringing um i'm my  family's great now we've all come  together and we've all forgiven and and  we love each other but just growing up  and not feeling like you had somebody to  to share your experiences with or to ask  questions too that inspired me to get  into teaching and then just working with  the student population that has a very  similar upbringing just the city of  philadelphia in general has a very  similar story and just to be that person  that i always wanted wanted as a as a  child just that's where my passion comes  from that is so powerful you know and  this these times are so unprecedented  kids are learning such different ways  now how has we love philly your group  how has it changed the students views  towards learning  oh it it brings it to their actual it  makes it real for them um so example  right now we're taking a shipping  container we're turning it into a tiny  home with the intention for the students  to sell it so and keep the money for it  oh it teaches them so much right yes  it's us working together what would you  like to do now let me co-create and  provide you the resources in order for  your for you to create what you want in  this reality and that's where the boss  came from that's where the shipping came  container came from it all came from  students brains and i just provided the  resources and the and the quitter  backing in order to help them create it  we just love everything that you're  doing and we're not the only ones by the  way gateway wants to give you ten  thousand dollars  continue all the good work that you are  doing thank you so much  [Applause]  and guess what that is not all they're  going to give you 10 laptop computers  for the students to further their  education as  oh my well thank you so much guys i  appreciate you all  it's it's yeah i'm i'm speechless thank  you gateway thank you ross thank you  drew all the beautiful people i've  interacted with just getting on this  show i appreciate all of you  well we appreciate it we appreciate you  and we love you and we love your story  and people need to see it and be  inspired  and  try different approaches  let's not stay stuck and you're an  inspiration to me with that thank you  thank you  [Music]
 

